  "notable_quotes": [
    "The isolated polymers show anion-dependent structural diversity; Zn/acetate yields 2D, while Zn/SO4 produces a more open 3D channel structure.",
    "Changing the anion strongly alters topology: Cd/Br gives helical-channel 3D nets, whereas Cd/SO4 gives 2D CdSO4 sheets linked into a different 3D framework.",
    "Only compounds 2 and 3 had fluorescent properties examined, and their emissions differed, likely because of metal identity, coordination environment, and topology."
